# Burning Steppes - Completionist (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# Every Burning Steppes accept in the local census (59 quests,
# docs/burning-steppes-census.md, key 1428, band 48-60) appears exactly once
# as an accept; 59 turnins close every record that ends anywhere in the data,
# including note-only turn-ins where the end has no placed spawn (the Spirit,
# Drakkisath's Brand). Set aside with reasons in the census: the Horde trio
# 4121/3822/8998, the 4023 twin, 5 repeatable Librams, 2 Lunar elders, 11
# unpicked Bodley variants. No race header: nothing contracted is
# race-locked; the 9-quest Dreadsteed chain carries only Warlock gates.
# Interior and spawnless objectives ride bare completes at the data-placed
# Blackrock anchors (the Meeting Stones, the Orb of Command) or bare with an
# honest note - nothing invented. Ungateable outside pres (4223 Redridge for
# 4224, 4282 for 4322, 5001 for 5002, 4907 Winterspring for 4734, 4324 Tanaris
# for 4136, 7625 Darkshore for 7629, 9032 Horde-side for 8961) ride as
# structural warnings with the chain named; their completes and turn-ins
# stand alone in `when onquest` mini-steps. Expedition legs switch frames
# deliberately and switch back.
guide butler-routes-completionist/burning-steppes
title Burning Steppes
levels 48-60
zone Burning Steppes
faction Alliance
category Leveling
folder Eastern Kingdoms
coords live
version 1

step Keeshan's Post - Missing in Action

  zone map 1428

  accept 219 -- Missing In Action - Corporal Keeshan; the escort runs to Redridge, below the band but contracted as the in-zone accept
  zone map 1433
  complete 219 @28.27,48.7 -- escort Corporal Keeshan back to Redridge
  turnin 219 -- Missing In Action - Keeshan to Marshal Marris
  zone map 1428
  tip 219 accepts in-zone at minLevel 19 and walks far below the band; the completionist rule keeps it, flagged outlier in the census.

